Quest Lumberjack Duties Peon Chop
    Events
        Unit - A unit Is issued an order targeting an object
    Conditions
        (Issued order) Equal to (Order(harvest))
        (Ordered unit) Equal to LumberPeon
        (LumberPeon is alive) Equal to True
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        -------- Set follow --------
        Set VariableSet FollowSystem_Source = LumberPeon
        Set VariableSet FollowSystem_Target = Nazgrek
        Custom script:   call FollowSystem_RemoveUnit(udg_FollowSystem_Source)
        Trigger - Turn off Quest Lumberjack Duties Peon Near tree <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off Quest Lumberjack Duties Peon Random Getting Lost <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off Quest Lumberjack Duties Peon Chat <gen>
        -------- Peon starts harvesting --------
        -------- DEBUG --------
        Game - Display to (All players) the text: (DEBUG:  + (LumperPeon >>  + Peon starts harvesting wood))
        -------- DEBUG --------
        Set VariableSet QuestLumberjackPeonHarvesting = True
        Set VariableSet QuestLumberjackDutiesTree = (Target destructible of issued order)
        If ((LumberPeon is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from LumberPeon named Peon: Play OrcPeon_0009 <gen> and display Choppin' away! Hope....  Modify duration: Set to 4.00 seconds and Wait
        If ((LumberPeon is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
        Wait 2.00 seconds
        If ((LumberPeon is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from LumberPeon named Peon: Play OrcPeon_0010 <gen> and display Feel da power of me....  Modify duration: Set to 4.00 seconds and Wait
        If ((LumberPeon is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
        Wait 2.00 seconds
        If ((LumberPeon is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
        -------- Kill the tree and insert pathing blocker --------
        Destructible - Kill QuestLumberjackDutiesTree
        Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of QuestLumberjackDutiesTree)
        Destructible - Create a Pathing Blocker (Ground) (lumber quest) at VarPoint facing (Random angle) with scale 1.00 and variation 0
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
        Wait 1.00 seconds
        If ((LumberPeon is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
        Unit - Order LumberPeon to Stop.
        Set VariableSet QuestLumberjackPeonHarvesting = False
        -------- Peon ready --------
        -------- Set chance to receive lumber --------
        Set VariableSet QuestLumberjackChance = (Random integer number between 1 and 2)
        -------- Good wood = Receive item Pile of Wood --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                QuestLumberjackChance Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from LumberPeon named Peon: Play OrcPeon_0011 <gen> and display Hmm, dis lumber fee....  Modify duration: Set to 5.00 seconds and Wait
                Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of LumberPeon)
                Item - Create Pile Of Wood at VarPoint
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                Set VariableSet QuestLumberjackChance = 0
            Else - Actions
        -------- Bad wood = no items received --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        QuestLumberjackChance Equal to 2
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet QuestLumberjackChanceSpeak = (Random integer number between 1 and 3)
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        QuestLumberjackChanceSpeak Equal to 1
                    Then - Actions
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from LumberPeon named Peon: Play OrcPeon_0012 <gen> and display Uh-oh, boss... bad ....  Modify duration: Set to 3.00 seconds and Wait
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        QuestLumberjackChanceSpeak Equal to 2
                    Then - Actions
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from LumberPeon named Peon: Play OrcPeon_0013 <gen> and display Wood no good wood, ....  Modify duration: Set to 3.00 seconds and Wait
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        QuestLumberjackChanceSpeak Equal to 3
                    Then - Actions
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from LumberPeon named Peon: Play OrcPeon_0014 <gen> and display Eh... Uhhum... Wood....  Modify duration: Set to 5.00 seconds and Wait
                    Else - Actions
                Set VariableSet QuestLumberjackChanceSpeak = 0
                Set VariableSet QuestLumberjackChance = 0
            Else - Actions
        -------- Make peon return lumber (e.g., remove harvested lumber) --------
        Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of LumberPeon)
        Unit - Create 1 Lumber return for Player 2 (Blue) at VarPoint facing Default building facing degrees
        Set VariableSet LumberReturnUnit = (Last created unit)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
        Unit - Order LumberPeon to Right-Click LumberReturnUnit
        If ((LumberPeon is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
        Wait 0.20 seconds
        Unit - Order LumberPeon to Stop.
        If ((LumberPeon is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
        Unit - Remove LumberReturnUnit from the game
        Wait 1.00 seconds
        If ((LumberPeon is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
        -------- Set follow --------
        Set VariableSet FollowSystem_Source = LumberPeon
        Set VariableSet FollowSystem_Target = Nazgrek
        Custom script:   call FollowSystem_SetFollow(udg_FollowSystem_Source, udg_FollowSystem_Target, 1200.0, true, 5.0, FOLLOW_STYLE_PASSIVE, true, true)
        Trigger - Turn on Quest Lumberjack Duties Peon Chat <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on Quest Lumberjack Duties Peon Random Getting Lost <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on Quest Lumberjack Duties Peon Near tree <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
